### Claude Code ###
.claude/*
# Track shared project skills; keep local settings (settings.local.json, locks) ignored.
!.claude/skills/

### Environment ###
.env
# Per-worktree direnv overrides. Never tracked: a committed .envrc would also apply to the `main` worktree, which
# runs against production Neon on purpose.
.envrc
.mcp.json

### Mac OS ###
.DS_Store

### Scala ###
.bsp/
# Metals writes this on import and pins its own sbt-bloop version; tracking it means a generated file
# drifts in git and its bloop pin ages independently of anything the build declares.
project/metals.sbt
/.idea/
.scala-build/

### Runtime ###
# Server per-job logs (job-logs.directory = logs/jobs in application.conf)
logs/
# No entry for the local-filesystem BodyStore: since #200 its root defaults to ${XDG_CACHE_HOME:-~/.cache}/ccas/bodies,
# outside the repo. A `cache/` directory here is a leftover from the pre-#200 default and is safe to delete.
